@startuml
title Veterinary Appointment – Sequence Diagram

actor Client
participant "Pet & Medical Care\n(Appointment)" as Appointment
participant "Pet & Medical Care\n(Medical Record)" as Record
participant "Invoicing\n(Invoice)" as Invoice
participant "Invoicing\n(Payment)" as Payment
participant "Billing System\n(Notification)" as Notification

' === Flujo ===
Client -> Appointment : Request appointment
Appointment --> Client : Confirm appointment scheduled

Client -> Appointment : Attend appointment
Appointment -> Record : Create medical record
Record --> Appointment : Record created

Appointment -> Invoice : Generate invoice
Invoice -> Payment : Process payment
Payment --> Invoice : Payment confirmed
Invoice --> Client : Invoice delivered

Invoice -> Notification : Send confirmation
Notification --> Client : Confirmation message delivered

@enduml
